    "body": "Hmm. I'm not sure this is quite right. A user agent could choose to unload in sequence, while still using separate event loops. E.g. it could avoid spinning up the new process until the old one is shut down.\r\n\r\nI think some of the phrasing from an early revision is probably necessary. E.g., if event loops are different, and the user agent is choosing to load the new document without finishing the unload of the previous document, then...",
